  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe35610c1c494fbcb959bc09baacea3d, type: 3}
  m_Name: PermissionGiver
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Kindrith.Dialogue::Kindrith.Dialogue.DialogueTree
  Archetype: 0
  EntryNodeId: node_0
  Nodes:
  - Id: node_0
    DemonLine: You've been so disciplined. One won't undo any of it. You know that,
      don't you?
    Options:
    - Text: One is how every streak ends. I'm not starting that math again.
      Class: 0
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1a
    - Text: Maybe. I don't know.
      Class: 1
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1b
    - Text: You're right. I have been disciplined.
      Class: 2
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1c
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_1a
    DemonLine: Okay. I hear you. But you're not addicted anymore, really. This isn't
      the old pattern. It's different now.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_1b
    DemonLine: "Of course you don't know. That's what I'm here for. Just weigh it
      \u2014 one, only one, and the streak stays if you want it to."
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_1c
    DemonLine: You have. And you deserve some ease. The work of quitting shouldn't
      also be the work of never resting.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_2
    DemonLine: Look, tomorrow morning you'll still be the person who did the hard
      thing for this many days. Nothing changes that. Nothing. One doesn't change
      that.
    Options:
    - Text: The person I'm becoming wouldn't pick one up. That's the thing that changes.
      Class: 0
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3a
    - Text: I just want to get past this moment.
      Class: 1
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3b
    - Text: You're right. Nothing changes. Okay.
      Class: 2
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3c
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3a
    DemonLine: ...That's a stronger answer than I expected.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3b
    DemonLine: Past this moment, sure. Past the next moment too. You have options.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3c
    DemonLine: Good. Let's step out for some air.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
